@startuml
actor Administrador
participant "Interfaz Bootstrap" as UI
participant "Controlador PHP" as PHP
database "PostgreSQL 18" as PG
participant "configurar_tabla()" as Config
participant "generar_triggers()" as Gen
Administrador -> UI : Seleccionar tabla, columnas y eventos
UI -> PHP : POST + token CSRF
PHP -> PG : Consultar catálogo y validar valores
PHP -> Config : SELECT configurar_tabla(... JSONB)
Config -> PG : Guardar tabla, columnas, reglas y versión
Config -> Gen : regenerar triggers
loop INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE
  Gen -> PG : DROP TRIGGER IF EXISTS
  alt Hay regla activa
    Gen -> PG : CREATE TRIGGER AFTER ...
  end
end
Gen --> Config : terminado
Config --> PHP : id_tabla
PHP --> UI : Mostrar confirmación
@enduml
